Reason: 0result.sql uses ROW_NUMBER to select exactly three products per division (avoiding the extra‑rows issue that RANK can introduce on ties) and filters the 2021 calendar year with a simple BETWEEN clause that works across SQL engines. The other queries either risk averaging more than three products (because of RANK) or rely on engine‑specific functions (strftime) for the date filter.